    "Name": "Celerity CLR-03OMM",
    "Details": "Piloted remotely by Rodric Wilhelm, this 'Mech is intended as a \"pet\" for the Drone Command Console equipped PXH-7KJ Phoenix Hawk Jasmine in the Solaris Games, Rajah is a much cheaper refit of the standard ComStar Celerity. Swapping out the XXL engine for a standard 120-rated engine and removing the MASC halves its ground speed, but the swap makes it much cheaper to field, handy as it only boasts an extra half-ton of armor with the extra weight going towards three groups of spikes and a pair of Clan-tech ER medium lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Quad Mech (Squad)</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.96</color></b>",
